+#### Deprecated
+
+- `\mod_quiz\local\override_manager::get_effective_open_close_times()` has been deprecated in favour of `\mod_quiz\local\override_manager::get_effective_times()`. The deprecated method still works and returns only the `timeopen` and `timeclose` keys. It emits a `DEBUG_DEVELOPER` notice when called. Final deprecation is planned for Moodle 6.0.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89711](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89711)
+
